% D-0258, e2e stream seed 3104 model 81, shrunk: SAT; the BRIDGED e2e path writes a .pbp veripb cannot parse (a label never assigned) on global_cardinality with an EMPTY cover over repeated variables; the --e2e solver path VERIFIES: same bridge defect as e2e_bridge_gcc_repeat_var_sat.
predicate baguette_global_cardinality(array [int] of var int: x,array [int] of int: cover,array [int] of var int: counts);
var 0..3: x0:: output_var;
var -1..2: x1:: output_var;
var bool: b0:: output_var;
var bool: b1:: output_var;
var bool: b2:: output_var;
array [1..4] of var int: X_INTRODUCED_16_ ::var_is_introduced  = [x0,x1,x0,x1];
